  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-toolbox",
      "title": {
        "en": "Toolbox",
        "zh": "工具栏"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds a Toolbox entry to the left sidebar of the DSH Web GUI. The panel shows a card grid; click a card to open its tool. Currently four tools ship: a JSON formatter, which pretty-prints JSON and reports the exact position of a syntax error; an XML formatter, which indents XML and reports the exact position of a syntax error; a JSON comparison, which puts two JSON documents side by side and lists every way they differ, each with its path; and an XML comparison, which does the same for two XML documents. Everything runs in this browser — no text leaves your machine — and nothing is stored between visits. Removing the plugin removes the entry and its tools.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 界面的左侧栏新增「工具栏」入口。面板以卡片形式展示工具，点击卡片进入该工具。目前提供四个工具：JSON 格式化（美化 JSON，并精确报告语法错误的位置）、XML 格式化（缩进 XML，并精确报告语法错误的位置）、JSON 文本比较（并排放两份 JSON 文档，列出它们的每一处不同，并给出每处的路径）和 XML 文本比较（对两份 XML 文档做同样的事）。全部处理都在当前浏览器内完成，内容不会离开你的机器，也不会在下次打开时保留。卸载插件后入口与工具一并移除。"
      },
